[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]Commander White v0.1.0[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Belt physics that follows movement and body adjustments.
[*]Facial-expression controls and synchronized facial playback for supported CSS animations and CINE playback.
[*]52 additional idle animations through CSS Shared Assets.
[/list]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/1f777697ad6fb93f9cfbcf4867fa677cd7ea0eca/docs/media/v1.0.0/commander-white-expressions.jpg[/img]

[b]Fixes and improvements[/b]
[list]
[*]Smoothed skirt motion while preserving the existing clothing controls.
[*]Improved motion for the hanging hair strands.
[*]Fixed the obvious inward and sideways foot tilt when walking, with boots shown or hidden. Jogging and sprinting retain their accepted animations.
[*]Updated compatibility with the combined CSS Shared Assets package and customized Genessa doubles.
[*]Removed the Development label from the outfit name.
[/list]

Close the game, update CSS to v1.0.0 and install its matching CSS Shared Assets download. Replace the previous Commander White package with all three files from this download. Keep your CSS settings and profiles.

Minor clipping can remain in some poses or at extreme body settings.
